<sect3 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_WD_EX1_1autotoc_md511">
<title>Globals</title>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>uint32_t wakeCount</computeroutput>: Counter for the number of wakeup interrupts.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>uint32_t loopCount</computeroutput>: Counter for the number of main loop iterations.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><table rows="2" cols="2"><row>
